# Journey to Windurst at status 3 with RoV's The Path Untraveled current, logging into Heaven's Tower, then a warp to
# Windurst Woods and back with the zone-in left open. The zone-in plays 42; its update answers with the eighth parameter
# 1; its finish moves to status 4. The last warp pair plays nothing, since status 4 has no zone-in arm. The first warp
# to Windurst Woods also plays SoA's Rumors from the West zone-in 839, whose finish sets SoA status 4.
lists Giddeus/Uu_Zhoumo/onTrigger Giddeus/onEventFinish/42 HeavensTower/Kupipi/onTrigger HeavensTower/onZoneIn/1 HeavensTower/onEventUpdate/42 HeavensTower/onEventFinish/42 HeavensTower/onEventFinish/238 WindurstWoods/Catalia/onTrigger WindurstWoods/Erpolant/onTrigger WindurstWoods/Forine/onTrigger WindurstWoods/Mourices/onTrade WindurstWoods/Mourices/onTrigger WindurstWoods/onEventFinish/457
char zone=HeavensTower pos=2,0.1,30 job=WAR lvl=30 nation=0
mission Rov ThePathUntraveled current
mission Sandoria JourneyToWindurst current
login
missionstatus Sandoria 3
warp 2,0.1,30 WindurstWoods
warp 2,0.1,30 HeavensTower open
update 42 option=0
finish
warp 2,0.1,30 WindurstWoods
warp 2,0.1,30 HeavensTower
